#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Add an operation to the back {#add-an-operation-to-the-back}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"An operation is added to the end of the DAGCircuit using the "
"`apply_operation_back()` method. This appends the specified gate to act on "
"the given qubits after all existing operations in the circuit.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/guides/DAG-"
"representation/extracted-outputs/3c144b49-0.avif)\n"
